    "the slug, the card renders with a gradient placeholder behind the name --",
    "still useful, still no broken image. The image URL pattern matches D1/D2:",
    "  ?w=600&q=85&auto=format&fit=crop",
    "",
    "Slugs are the URL-safe lowercase-hyphenated form of provider_name (see",
    "app/db/seed_helpers.py for the canonical hook). Add or revise entries as",
    "real Provider slugs surface in prod; missing slugs degrade gracefully."
